      "source": [
        "# 🎙️ TurboVoiceCloner: Resemble-AI Chatterbox Edition\n",
        "**Status:** Dedicated Voice Cloning | **GPU:** T4 Required\n",
        "\n",
        "### 🛠️ सेटअप निर्देश:\n",
        "1. **GPU चालू करें:** Runtime → Change runtime type → GPU (T4)।\n",
        "2. **Step 1:** रिपॉजिटरी क्लोन और इंस्टॉलेशन के लिए चलाएं।"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# @title 🚀 Step 1: Clone Chatterbox & Install Dependencies\n",
        "import os\n",
        "os.environ['MPLBACKEND'] = 'Agg'\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Cloning Resemble-AI Chatterbox...\")\n",
        "!git clone https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox.git 2>/dev/null || echo \"Repo already exists\"\n",
        "%cd /content/chatterbox\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Installing Turbo High Speed Dependencies...\")\n",
        "# PyTorch CUDA 12.1 Setup\n",
        "!pip install torch==2.5.1+cu121 torchaudio==2.5.1+cu121 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121 -q\n",
        "\n",
        "# Chatterbox specific requirements\n",
        "!pip install -e . -q\n",
        "!pip install gradio==4.44.1 fastapi uvicorn pydub -q\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"✅ Installation Complete!\")"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# @title ⚙️ Step 2: Launch TTS UI (Red Bar Fix)\n",
        "import threading, time, uvicorn, gc\n",
        "from google.colab.output import serve_kernel_port_as_window\n",
        "\n",
        "# साफ़ सफाई (Clear Port)\n",
        "!fuser -k 8004/tcp 2>/dev/null || echo \"Port clear\"\n",
        "gc.collect()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"🚀 Starting Chatterbox TTS Server...\")\n",
        "\n",
        "def start_app():\n",
        "    # ऐप लॉन्च करने का कमांड (Chatterbox के स्ट्रक्चर के अनुसार)\n",
        "    !python3 -m uvicorn app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8004 --log-level error\n",
        "\n",
        "thread = threading.Thread(target=start_app, daemon=True)\n",
        "thread.start()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Waiting 40 seconds for GPU Model Loading...\")\n",
        "time.sleep(40) \n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"🎉 Click below to open Voice Cloner:\")\n",
        "serve_kernel_port_as_window(8004)"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  ],
